Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Cannot ping between namespaces

Solution: Verify IP forwarding is enabled: sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.ip_forward=1
Check that interfaces are up: ip link show
Verify routes in namespaces: sudo ip netns exec <zone> ip route
Issue: Iptables rules not blocking traffic

Solution: Check rule order with sudo iptables -L FORWARD -n -v --line-numbers
Ensure FORWARD chain default policy: sudo iptables -P FORWARD DROP
Verify rules are in correct chain (FORWARD, not INPUT/OUTPUT)
Issue: Wireshark/tshark permission denied

Solution: Add user to wireshark group: sudo usermod -a -G wireshark $USER
Log out and back in for group changes to take effect
Run with sudo if necessary: sudo tshark -i <interface>
Issue: Python scripts fail with import errors

Solution: Install required packages: pip3 install <package-name>
Verify Python 3 is being used: python3 --version
Check script has execute permissions: chmod +x script.py
